      ],
      "text": "**It may improve a little tomorrow (Sunday, October 18), but it’s uncertain.** Singapore’s NEA expects showers and weaker winds, which could reduce smoke drifting in from Kalimantan; haze from Sumatra may still reach Singapore. ([nea.gov.sg](https://www.nea.gov.sg/media/news/advisories/index/haze-situation-update-16-october-2026))\n\nI haven’t found a published PSI range for Sunday yet. Today’s readings were still unhealthy in places, so check NEA’s **1-hour PM2.5** readings tomorrow before planning outdoor activities. ([channelnewsasia.com](https://www.channelnewsasia.com/singapore/singapore-haze-psi-pm25-oct-17-6466816))",
